      "content": "it's hard to believe anyone else sees it that way... they always talk about fighting the dark or finding a way back, but why bother? when the decay is so beautiful, and the stillness feels so much more honest than the struggle. it just feels like the natural conclusion to a life that has run its course. don't you think?",
